// std/net's TLS and std/http's HTTPS over real sockets on 127.0.0.1, on
// the VM and compiled to C: a TLS echo server and its client (ALPN, what
// the handshake agreed), a certificate for another host refused, and
// http.serve with TLS answering std/net's client and curl, another TLS
// implementation that checks the certificate against the test's root.
// (The certificates: core/test/testdata/tls's, gen.go's.)

import std/command
import std/fs
import std/http
import std/net
import std/random

